From 123fad9b48df664a39e9fdfb7acb53e0ab2bd926 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:02:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Never ask where the image lives, Room in capitals, Game speed
 Normal online

The setup never asks whether to copy the disc image into the data folder: it is used where it is (Android still copies, an app cannot
read elsewhere). The Room is kept in capitals, as typed, shown and saved. While the game is online (hosting, joining, in a group or on
the relay) Game speed is locked to Normal: the row is disabled, and no pacing code honours Unlimited (adhoc_unthrottled); the setting is
kept and applies again when the session ends.
